// Package generate turns a livewire registry into its artifacts (D19): the TypeScript client
// (types.ts, filters.ts, api.ts and the copied runtime.ts and vue.ts) and the OpenAPI 3.0.3
// document; the Go client and the command-line client follow in WP7. Write is the entry
// point; everything it writes is deterministic, byte for byte, for one registry and one
// Options value, and carries the header `Code generated by livewire. DO NOT EDIT.`.
//
// The runtime/ directory holds the TypeScript runtime sources the generator copies; they are
// tested there under bun.
package generate
